{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate! Great to hear from you! Quite a week since we last talked - something awesome happened to me!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-d7b63559715cc1333a0e1010", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.083544+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d7b63559715cc1333a0e1010", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d7b63559715cc1333a0e1010", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Jo! Great hearing from you! What happened?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-3a3e1f05797049dd0dd888a7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.112609+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3a3e1f05797049dd0dd888a7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3a3e1f05797049dd0dd888a7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I went hiking and found some more amazing trails in my town. It was such an awesome experience! I think I am an expert hiker now."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-383060f3a7a754a1b542379f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.137862+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "383060f3a7a754a1b542379f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "383060f3a7a754a1b542379f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Sounds great, Jo! Happy you had an awesome experience. Did you happen to take any photos of it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-52ca234afef950e5b3c45f5a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.159312+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "52ca234afef950e5b3c45f5a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "52ca234afef950e5b3c45f5a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Yeah, I did! Loved this spot on the hike. The rush of the water was so soothing."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-bd6e1ec45e4511847172e340", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.187088+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bd6e1ec45e4511847172e340", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bd6e1ec45e4511847172e340", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Wow, looks great! Where did you take this picture? I love the dark sky and green scenery."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-9e1e7c0f83199d417c4f7a10", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.204752+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9e1e7c0f83199d417c4f7a10", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9e1e7c0f83199d417c4f7a10", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks! I took this photo at a beautiful location called Whispering Falls. It was really peaceful and serene."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-7cda9ffd1c1bbb5c325c7380", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.219886+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7cda9ffd1c1bbb5c325c7380", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7cda9ffd1c1bbb5c325c7380", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I wish I could have been there! Your hikes sound like a blast."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-f7be54b591e3ebe1b1010e65", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.236408+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f7be54b591e3ebe1b1010e65", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f7be54b591e3ebe1b1010e65", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: It was awesome, Nate. The sound of that place and the beauty of nature made me so calm and peaceful. Everything else faded away and all that mattered was the present."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-eead5de313ce4d3d60962aef", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.253749+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "eead5de313ce4d3d60962aef", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "eead5de313ce4d3d60962aef", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That's great. Glad you found a spot that calms you down - nature sure can be a break from the craziness."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-fc5bb7bc2b7d2765ed9475e8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.278088+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fc5bb7bc2b7d2765ed9475e8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fc5bb7bc2b7d2765ed9475e8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Nature totally inspires me and it's so calming to be surrounded by its beauty. Hiking has opened up a whole new world for me and I feel like a different person now."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-d2c43a4214ba2a6bfee8d3f7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.302706+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d2c43a4214ba2a6bfee8d3f7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d2c43a4214ba2a6bfee8d3f7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Wow, Jo, that's really cool! It's great to have something that gets those creative juices flowing."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-69030e1401121ba0fe075ea2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.322951+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "69030e1401121ba0fe075ea2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "69030e1401121ba0fe075ea2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I always feel like I could write a whole movie when I'm out there in cool places like that!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-1167d75e0dfc7c4dbb91040a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.338870+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1167d75e0dfc7c4dbb91040a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1167d75e0dfc7c4dbb91040a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Wow! That's really cool that it inspires you that much! For me I just get deep in thought and think about my life or new recipes."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-e38aab90108339c3bfd582bf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.356376+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e38aab90108339c3bfd582bf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e38aab90108339c3bfd582bf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I think about my life too sometimes when I'm out and about, but there was something special about these trails that made me feel like writing a drama."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-6d0fe11a7eb0a2a90a380c13", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.372878+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6d0fe11a7eb0a2a90a380c13", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6d0fe11a7eb0a2a90a380c13", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey, we should go together sometime, don't you think? Maybe I'll start to think of a drama myself and publish my own screenplay."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-97a22530f32b1a0d93d72790", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.392041+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "97a22530f32b1a0d93d72790", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "97a22530f32b1a0d93d72790", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Haha, now that would be something! Sure, you should come down and join me on the trails sometime!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-cd4ef87698e897cdced3e891", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.407695+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cd4ef87698e897cdced3e891", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cd4ef87698e897cdced3e891", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Sounds like a plan! Thanks for the invite Joanna!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-d485592463a0ec58bb6fbea5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.424154+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d485592463a0ec58bb6fbea5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d485592463a0ec58bb6fbea5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Sure thing Nate! See you later!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-59cda5d6118f3d2688e71e07", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.439902+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "59cda5d6118f3d2688e71e07", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "59cda5d6118f3d2688e71e07", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: See ya!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_11-587cefaea3855c94373ab212", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:21:51.456778+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "587cefaea3855c94373ab212", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "587cefaea3855c94373ab212", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
